    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ce1d631956886854303e56d"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "We shall see.\n\nI have a lot of long standing debts that need to be paid first, but yes, afterwards I can became a pilot again.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "Very well. Good luck in the future.",
