      "index": 7,
      "text": "Considering the reputation of the Black Widow, that might be an issue for her to get employment, although nothing stops her from starting her own unit all made of Kerensky copycats.\n\nStill, since she is now available we might consider to recruit her, considering how she fought against us in the past.",
